   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「もう だいじょうぶじゃ\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"It's all over now, eh.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES10:52ed0",
   "off": 339664,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  知識聖堂のお嬢さん\r  すまんかったのう\u0010\b",
   "en": "I've put you to a deal of trouble, young lady from the Temple of Knowledge, eh?\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES10:52efb",
   "off": 339707,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  グリソムは…\r  奥さんには気の毒\r  じゃが…\u0010\b",
   "en": "As for Grissom... it's hard on his wife, but...\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES10:52f2b",
   "off": 339755,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  何も言わないで\r  そっとしといて\r  やってくれ」\u0010\u0017\b",
   "en": "don't say anything. Just leave her be, would ya.\"\u0010\u0017\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
